      en: ["The lake is located approximately 11 kilometers northwest of the city of Daraa.", "Muzairib was historically a key stop for pilgrims on the Hajj route to Mecca.", "The lake is fed by natural subterranean karst springs in the Hauran region.", "Water levels have dropped significantly in recent years due to over-pumping.", "The surrounding area is a major center for cereal and vegetable production.", "The lake's outflow contributes to the Yarmouk River, a major tributary of the Jordan."],
