      en: ["The primary tree species in the forest is the Turkish pine (Pinus brutia).", "The forest is located in the northern Lattakia Governorate, near the Turkish border.", "The area receives high annual rainfall, often exceeding 800 mm.", "In antiquity, the timber from this region was extensively used for shipbuilding.", "The forest is home to rare orchid species and various endemic Mediterranean plants.", "The terrain reaches elevations of up to 800 meters above sea level."],
