      en: ["Measuring roughly 6 km, it is the shortest river in the country.", "The average discharge of the river is approximately 14 cubic meters per second.", "It provides drinking water for over one million people on the Syrian coast.", "The Al-Sinn spring is one of the most prolific karst springs in the Middle East.", "The ancient archaeological site of Tell Sukas is located near the river.", "The water temperature remains constant throughout the year at about 17-18°C."],
